{"id":"en_don-t-mess-with-dragon-mom","title":"Don't Mess With Dragon Mom","titleEn":"Don't Mess With Dragon Mom","description":"Seraphina, once a supreme dragon archmage and savior of the empire, chooses to live quietly as an impoverished single mother so her daughter can grow up normally. That peaceful life shatters when the girl, who possesses remarkable talents of her own, is falsely accused of dark magic by corrupt officials and condemned to death by hanging. Casting aside her disguise, Seraphina calls forth an enormous dragon and reveals the full, terrifying extent of her power in order to punish those responsible and save her child.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/dont-mess-with-dragon-mom/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/dont-mess-with-dragon-mom/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy Romance","Karma Payback","Multiple Identities","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djnpo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_don-t-mess-with-dragon-mom_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djnpo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_don-t-mess-with-dragon-mom_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djnpo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_don-t-mess-with-dragon-mom_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djnpo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_don-t-mess-with-dragon-mom_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/